# docs structure ideas

Prompt = "What should the model do for this task?"
Agent spec (AGENT.md) = "How should this agent behave overall?"
Reference = "What are the rules, standards, and contracts?"
Guide = "How do I perform a task?"
Concept = "What is this topic and why does it matter?"

